  <item>
    <title>给朋友们的一封感谢信</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697a5d8416714a679cc62ef2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697a5d8416714a679cc62ef2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在yoyo酱的鼓励下，晓可酱</span><strong><span>震撼首发</span></strong><span>单飞一期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>突然更新，</span><strong><span>缺少</span></strong><span>我们至关重要的</span><strong><span>后期</span></strong><span>，所以本期无音乐无剪辑无大纲，随心所欲。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>朋友是自己选择家人</span></strong><span>，很开心能遇见大家，成为我生活中很重要的一部分。晓可酱从刚开始的大二已经来到了大四，用声音记录下我的经历，对一个记忆内存条有限的人，保存了好多每年的变化，让我可以记得很久很久。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后以上朋友排名不分先后哈，我要做个</span><strong><span>端水大师</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a>to雪婷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>to杨总</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a>to雪婷和杨总</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a>to楠姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>to学姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a>to黄黄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a>to所有朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a>要约和承诺这个知识点请复习一下哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a>to小情侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a>神奇的世界线收束</span></p>]]></description>
