  <item>
    <title>不会韩语 独自一人 如何开启济州岛自由行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f95ce481cdab3a93f2d05f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f95ce481cdab3a93f2d05f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Sep 2024 13:57:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hey小伙伴们~ 👋</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们的旅行小能手又来啦！这个月1号 晓可酱带着一颗自由的心，独自踏上了前往济州岛的旅程～🛫让我们为勇气可嘉的晓可酱鼓掌！时隔一个月，两位拖更人士终于录好了这一期济州游玩攻略，也许不专业全面，但却是21岁的晓可第一次出国游的真切体验。迎来十一假期，希望这期内容可以帮助和鼓励到第一次想出国去济州岛游玩的朋友们。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>旅行时间线🚌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">3:10</a> 国内航空和国际航空安检区别</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">8:34</a> 出境游app推荐 以及出行前准备</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 小小沟通 轻松拿捏</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 韩国点菜初体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 夜晚的海水浴场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 济州涯月邑攻略</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 关于城山日出峰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 牛岛环岛骑行</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 这个助力车怎么骑不动啊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 原来我还是个青少年啊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 在韩最后一次购物</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>旅行结束</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于照片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>机场：</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp2rj3WD1VDzZijun2Njhlniresc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>青年旅馆：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPEQA86AcxU5sgcd5o_LOJl_DAT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>晴天的海水浴场：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmD2Wpszw38YaFYr8H2nNF_oCQvX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>牛岛游艇：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlZwGpcyspnJ9gjTbjTcCd0VuQs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>充满中文的纺古建筑：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpVPwK6az44CjPjFzjpuv1P7BqA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>旅行结束🚌 感谢收听🌸🌸🌸</span></p>]]></description>
