  <item>
    <title>狂喜播客节｜今天很狂 明天更狂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bab7f333591c27bea1e180</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bab7f333591c27bea1e180</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Aug 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>昨天，晓可去参加第一届线下狂喜播客节啦！！！播客人狂喜 撒花撒花🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客制作者不仅仅是声音的传递者，更是思想的交流场和文化的传播者。以其独特的魅力吸引着越来越多的人参与其中，共同构建了一个多元化、包容性的声音世界。我们期待着未来能有更多这样的机会，与更多优秀的主播和听众相聚一堂，共同探索声音的魅力与可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span>晓可参加的这次线下见面会跨越了屏幕的界限，与那些平日里只闻其声、未见其人的播客主播们面对面交流，更深刻地感受到了声音背后的温度与力量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏰showtime</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">2:39</a> 参加狂喜播客节的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">7:44</a> 线下活动的氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">8:40</a> 现实生活中主播和节目中印象的反差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">9:40</a> 活动中合影的趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 嘉宾分享的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 惠子老师对播客新人的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 爱情时间长了会变成亲情吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 在听没听过的播客主线下播客的感受</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>🎵本期BGM:人生浪费指南—夏日入侵企画</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>现场活动照片</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgaT9xu7Ib6ZrQfnf9awxojRvhO5.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fonfp4I5QcWzyiceVSfc-45fs7B1.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnoldw_X7t1Hgz7v9tstMYa0VhVs.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>与惠子老师的合影</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjvHEtRfHkaQvqcwsN-hwV-Ksaj3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播：悠悠｜晓可</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听🌸🌸🌸</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh2dj8pdk1R8vMjU0d1eUU2bAzCq.m4a" length="32136518" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiysGmaD3MhTWJeoxq-W-go9ZdL0.jpg"/>
