    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b3afe71ed6d5797f325893</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jan 2024 13:13:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>是什么让好奇心对话时隔半年再次更新！</span></p><span></span><p><span>是我们晓可同学迎来了寒假！！哦耶</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁着放假 晓可去了重庆和成都玩了一圈 也是晓可第一次独自出门旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅途时间线🚌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 重庆初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 不愧是重庆 无辣不欢啊无辣不欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 来重庆总要喝茶颜悦色吧&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 重庆活该它赚钱啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 重庆的文化和包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 成都之行和遍地的熊猫元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 推荐成都博物馆和大熊猫基地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 冷知识！大熊猫VS小熊猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 重庆和成都旅游体验的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅途结束🚌</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>photo</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnhox7xCQiMYLZSaISTB_XjUFOFw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FotqMw27fkcX7MK9JyNWAJorMZdg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-ssCqU3HS-JH5tsZqZCe4VPfBp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrazwaO9DGv9Kxi8lF_UMhQp7r6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRN3HviRkA8lMJy78-OSt16kYLW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播｜</span><strong><span>悠悠 晓可</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大家寒假快乐！顺便提前新年快乐🎊</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听 本期撒花🎉</span></p>]]></description>
