  <item>
    <title>杭州City walk｜日行三万步！和基建狂魔拼中国速度</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64eb70e33fa4090b7466f4ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64eb70e33fa4090b7466f4ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 2023 15:50:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日刷三万步杭州Citywalk 正式安排！</span></p><span></span><p><span>杭州啊杭州，不愧是基建狂魔和天堂般共同的存在。这儿拥有令人惊叹的自然美景——西湖。哦，这可不是一个普通的湖泊，它是令人屏息的美丽。无论是秋天的枫叶还是春天的樱花，西湖总是展现着它无尽的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然啦，一个城市的魅力还不只是这些。杭州作为中国的“美食”之都，它的美食文化更是让人流连忘返。记得尝试一下传统的杭帮菜，比如西湖醋鱼和东坡肉。（虽然晓可不推荐）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期还有一些神奇的体验，欢迎大家完整收听！谢谢大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>walk时间线🚶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>亚运气氛很到位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a>杭州高温预警 甜品秒变甜品汤</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a>好吃到爆的三明治 入股不亏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a>哇 好多人啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 此时 两位高贵的公主在品尝优雅的下午茶（DIY的）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 土狗进大观园 时尚都是看不懂的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 江南骑行体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 令人头秃的滴滴师傅摩斯密码</span></p><span></span><p><span>walk结束🎉</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lglYfPLMG84FFJl-tlRSpwrjYyJt.m4a" length="30448547" type="audio/mp4"/>
